# 8. Promise Methods — Your Question Today

You asked:

> "Promise all methods return array?"

### Correct answer

Not all Promise methods return arrays.

| Method                 | Returns         |
| ---------------------- | --------------- |
| `Promise.all()`        | ✅ Array         |
| `Promise.allSettled()` | ✅ Array         |
| `Promise.race()`       | ❌ Single result |
| `Promise.any()`        | ❌ Single result |

### Easy memory trick

```text
ALL        → ARRAY
ALLSETTLED → ARRAY
RACE       → ONE
ANY        → ONE
```

